[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5861504924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114415#issuecomment-5861504924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114415","id":5861504924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXV93nA","user":{"login":"OrcWarchief","id":86047667,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDQ3NjY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86047667?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief","html_url":"https://github.com/OrcWarchief","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OrcWarchief/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-28T01:01:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T01:01:50Z","body":"Tested on Windows 11 Home with a local x86_64 development build.\r\n\r\n- Baseline: `6210a2fd88`\r\n- Applied this PR's commit `92c1bbd6ac` on top of the baseline using cherry-pick. The resulting local commit is `94b6b7cd61`.\r\n- Tested build: `4.8.dev.custom_build.94b6b7cd6`\r\n\r\nIn the built-in script editor, I enabled caret blinking and set the blink interval to 2 seconds to make the behavior easier to observe. I waited until the caret was invisible before each keypress.\r\n\r\nBefore applying the patch, pressing Tab indented the line but did not immediately show the caret. Space showed it immediately.\r\n\r\nAfter applying the patch and rebuilding, the caret appeared immediately for all of these inputs:\r\n\r\n- Tab\r\n- Shift+Tab on an indented line\r\n- Enter\r\n- Space\r\n\r\nThe Tab issue is resolved in this Windows test.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5861504924/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6088564688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114415#issuecomment-6088564688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114415","id":6088564688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaugf0A","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T20:18:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T20:18:25Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6088564688/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,